# Demand Forecasting using XGBoost

An end-to-end machine learning project for predicting product demand using historical sales, inventory, pricing, discount, promotion, and competitor pricing data.

The project covers exploratory data analysis (EDA), feature engineering, categorical encoding, XGBoost regression, hyperparameter tuning using RandomizedSearchCV, model evaluation, model serialization, and deployment through a Streamlit web application.

---

## Project Overview

Accurate demand forecasting can help businesses improve inventory planning, reduce stockouts and overstocking, and make better pricing and promotional decisions.

This project uses historical demand-related data to build an XGBoost regression model that predicts **Demand** based on selected product and pricing features.

